OL,3,GNEWSAImmigration centre expansion
OL,4,Ainquiry postponed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has postponed the public
OL,7,Finquiry into plans to more than double
OL,8,Fthe capacity of an immigration removal
OL,9,Fcentre (IRC).
OL,11,FCampsfield near Kidlington, reopened in
OL,12,FDecember after it was shut in 2018
OL,13,Ffollowing years of issues, including
OL,14,Friots, escapes and complaints about
OL,15,Fconditions.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,340,330,200,160,0,100
