OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAImmigration centre expansion
OL,4,Ainquiry postponed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe public inquiry into its expansion
OL,7,Fwas due to open at Cherwell District
OL,8,FCouncil in Banbury on 6 October but the
OL,9,FPlanning Inspectorate announced the
OL,10,Fpostponement on Friday, saying a
OL,11,Frevised timetable "will be issued in
OL,12,Fdue course".
OL,14,FCampaign group Coalition to Close
OL,15,FCampsfield said that followed their
OL,16,Fletter, requesting the Home Office
OL,17,Fpublishes more material relating to the
OL,18,Fplanning application.
